  <section class="topic-section wrap">
    <p><a href="/changes/#abilene-permit-revision-20250122">Open this revision in the project change log</a>.</p>
    <p class="memo-summary">The January 2025 amendment changes the permitted turbine configuration to five LM2500 units and five Titan 350 units, totaling 360.5 site-rated MW. The later O4721 issuance adds a documented federal operating-permit milestone. Neither record establishes current metered output or an open equipment procurement.</p>
    <dl class="memo-meta"><div><dt>Record reviewed</dt><dd>October 27, 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Taylor County, Texas</dd></div><div><dt>Applicant in the air record</dt><dd>Abilene DC 1, LLC</dd></div><div><dt>Purpose of this sample</dt><dd>Demonstrate evidence and change interpretation</dd></div></dl>
    <p class="topic-small">This is a retrospective demonstration using the existing reviewed public record. It is not a paid client case, a new discovery on October 27 or a finding that every permitted unit is operating.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="topic-section wrap">
    <h2>What changed in the record?</h2>
    <div class="topic-table" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Abilene before and after record"><table><caption>Changes described in the January 2025 modification technical review</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Field</th><th scope="col">Earlier configuration described by the review</th><th scope="col">Modified configuration</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td>Titan 350 count</td><td>6</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Titan 350 site rating</td><td>Review describes an increase; earlier rating not reproduced here</td><td>38 MW per unit</td></tr><tr><td>LM2500 count</td><td>6</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>LM2500 site rating</td><td>Review describes a reduction; earlier rating not reproduced here</td><td>34.1 MW per unit</td></tr><tr><td>LM2500 annual permitted hours</td><td>5,880</td><td>8,760</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>
    <p>The modification was received January 11, 2025 and approved January 22. It is a later filing under registration 177263. The original registration review records a receipt date of August 15, 2024; using January 11 as the first-ever filing would move the start of the timeline.</p>
    <p>The later O4721 federal operating permit was issued January 16, 2026. Its issuance should be kept as a separate regulatory event. It does not replace the need for current operating evidence.</p>
  </section>
